y have said you’d be good and follow the law, but what if you let your evil side out instead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story of conspiracy and chaos where your choices can change everything, so don’t be afraid to create some drama of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866980/extras/50d256968df1de0ea624664a8d20f91c.avif?t=1778079851\" width=600 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866980/extras/d7bf10bd28bab867a9103f1e66036a5b.poster.avif?t=1778079851\" width=600 height=265 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866980/extras/d7bf10bd28bab867a9103f1e66036a5b.webm?t=1778079851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of up to 12 characters, each with their own special skillsets and personalities, from the Mage to the Merchant. Create the perfect team to help you progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a variety of magical creatures and NPCs, all inspired by tabletop role-playing games. And don’t forget to collect any legendary treasures and items you might uncover during your adventures. You’ll need them to triumph over the dangers you’ll face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866980/extras/92480f64eb2fa193861a1e52af323485.avif?t=1778079851\" width=600 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it